Today we learn: Community Life. Let's go!

5
00:00:22.331 --> 00:00:26.531
Civic duty. Say it with me. Civic duty!

6
00:00:30.030 --> 00:00:34.497
Volunteer. Say it with me. Volunteer!

7
00:00:38.062 --> 00:00:41.829
Neighborly. Say it with me. Neighborly!

8
00:00:45.320 --> 00:00:50.053
Local initiative. Say it with me. Local initiative!

9
00:00:53.492 --> 00:00:57.358
Charity. Say it with me. Charity!

10
00:01:00.857 --> 00:01:04.940
Collaborate. Say it with me. Collaborate!

11
00:01:08.443 --> 00:01:12.593
Outreach. Say it with me. Outreach!

12
00:01:16.099 --> 00:01:20.682
Solidarity. Say it with me. Solidarity!

13
00:01:24.186 --> 00:01:28.019
Neighbor. Say it with me. Neighbor!

14
00:01:31.504 --> 00:01:35.053
Gather. Say it with me. Gather!

15
00:01:38.569 --> 00:01:48.878
Grammar time! can or could for suggestions. Listen. We can volunteer. We could organize a charity event.

16
00:01:48.928 --> 00:01:55.458
Your turn. Say it with me. We can volunteer. We could organize a charity event.

17
00:02:00.656 --> 00:02:11.808
Volunteering for a local initiative taught me about civic duty. Being neighborly and showing solidarity, our community collaborates on charity outreach every year.

18
