I like this story!

19
00:02:14.311 --> 00:02:19.546
Look! What's the word?

20
00:02:19.596 --> 00:02:20.746
Neighborly!

21
00:02:21.696 --> 00:02:27.078
Look! What's the word?

22
00:02:27.128 --> 00:02:28.278
Outreach!

23
00:02:29.353 --> 00:02:37.664
Think and answer. How can people contribute to their community?

24
00:02:37.714 --> 00:02:38.864
Great answer!

25
00:02:39.857 --> 00:02:44.399
Great work today! See you next time. Goodbye!

26
